CURVATURE AND FLOW CONTRACT

κ : X → ℝ       curvature observable
ρ : X → ℝ       residue observable
τ(M)            topological state domain

An action L_g preserves curvature on the admitted domain iff:
    κ(L_g(x)) = κ(x) for all x ∈ τ(M).

An action preserves topology and flow iff both structures on τ(M) are
preserved. These are domain-level conditions, not inferred from a finite cycle.
